{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52026","headline":"冬夜载酒於乡馆寻崔使君善爲 · 王绩","name":"冬夜载酒於乡馆寻崔使君善爲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"思君夜渐阑，载酒一相看。\n野馆含烟冷，山衣犯雪寒。\n停车聊捧袂，倒屣共临盘。\n今夕山阴赏，谁知逢道安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}